        {
          "text": "Muuya wa-Mwami Jehova mpuuli alindime, nkaambo Jehova wandinanika kuti nkambaukile bacete makani mabotu, wandituma kuzooanga batyokede mumyoyo, kuzooletela bazike mulao wabulubusi akujalwida baange intolongo, ",
