        },
        {
          "text": "kugwasya baabo balila mu-Zioni, bapegwe ingala mucibaka catwe, amafuta aabusekelezi mucibaka cakulila, cikobela cakutembaula mucibaka camoyo uulemedwe, kuti bategwe mibanga yabululami njaakasimpika Jehova, kuti alemekwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
