              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusekelela njoosekelela muli-Jehova, amoyo wangu uyookondwa muliLeza wangu, nkaambo wandisamika zyakusama zyalufutuko akundivumbya cikobela cabululami, mbubonya mbuli sibwiinga mbwalisamika ingala, ambuli nabwiinga mbwalisakatizya malungu aakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
